# Invalid/unknown RTC
name: invalid-rtc
version: 1
description: Reads with UNKNOWN RTC get null epoch and UNKNOWN status; sequence still monotonic.

boot
rtc UNKNOWN
read CHIP-001
assert last_result RECORDED
assert observation 0 clock_status UNKNOWN
assert observation 0 epoch_ms null
assert observation 0 sequence 1
read CHIP-002
assert observation 1 sequence 2
assert observation 1 clock_status UNKNOWN
assert observation 1 epoch_ms null
assert sequences_monotonic